#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:959
msgid "Rank and Percentile Tool"
msgstr "Verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:962
msgid "Rank and Percentile Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:964
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the rank "
"and percentile analysis tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Analysverktyget Rang "
"och percentil.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:977
msgid ""
"Use this tool to rank given data and to calculate the percentiles of each "
"data point."
msgstr ""
"Använd verktyget för att rangordna data och beräkna percentilen för varje "
"datapunkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:979
msgid ""
"Specify the datasets to use in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The given range can be grouped into "
"datasets by columns, by rows, or by areas."
msgstr ""
"Ange vilka data som ska användas i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Området kan delas in i "
"datamängder efter kolumner, rader eller områden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:983
msgid "For each dataset, the tool creates three columns in the output table:"
msgstr "För varje datamängd skapar verktyget tre kolumner i utdatatabellen:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:986
msgid ""
"The first column gives the indices of the ordered data from largest to "
"smallest data value."
msgstr ""
"Den första kolumnen visar positionerna för värdena, sorterade från störst "
"till minst."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:988
msgid ""
"The second column gives data values corresponding to the indices in the "
"first column."
msgstr ""
"Den andra kolumnen visar de värden som motsvarar positionerna i den första "
"kolumnen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:990
msgid ""
"The third column indicates the percentile of the data value in the second "
"column."
msgstr ""
"Den tredje kolumnen visar percentilen för värdet i den andra kolumnen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:994 C/gnumeric.xml:1200 C/gnumeric.xml:1806
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2088
msgid ""
"If you have labels in the first cell of each data set, select the "
"<quote><guilabel>Labels</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om den första cellen i varje datamängd innehåller en rubrik markerar du "
"<quote><guilabel>Rubriker</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:999
msgid "Some Example Data for the Rank and Percentile Tool"
msgstr "Exempeldata för verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1001
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of example "
"data for use with the rank and percentile analysis tool.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata för "
"analysverktyget Rang och percentil.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1013
msgid "Using the Rank and Percentile Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1014
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"rank-example-1\"/> shows some example data and <xref "
"linkend=\"rank-example-2\"/> the corresponding output."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"rank-example-1\"/> visar exempeldata och <xref "
"linkend=\"rank-example-2\"/> motsvarande utdata."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1019
msgid "Rank and Percentile Tool Output"
msgstr "Utdata från verktyget Rang och percentil"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1021
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"from a rank and percentile analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-rank-ex2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Utdata från en rang- "
"och percentilanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1033
msgid ""
"In the case of ties, the rank calculated by this tool differs from the value"
" of the RANK function for the same data. This tool calculates the rank as it"
" is normally used in Statistics: If two values are tied, the assigned rank "
"is the average rank for those entries. For example in <xref linkend=\"rank-"
"example-1\"/> the two values 10 are the second and third largest values. "
"Since they are equal each receives the rank of 2.5, the average of 2 and 3. "
"The rank function on the other hand assigns the rank as it is normally used "
"to determine placements. The two values 10 would therefore each receive a "
"rank of 2."
msgstr ""
"Om flera värden är lika skiljer sig rangordningen från verktyget från "
"resultatet av funktionen RANK för samma data. Verktyget använder den "
"statistiska rangordningen: lika värden får medelvärdet av sina rangtal. I "
"<xref linkend=\"rank-example-1\"/> är till exempel de två värdena 10 näst "
"störst respektive tredje störst. Eftersom värdena är lika får båda rangtalet"
" 2,5, medelvärdet av 2 och 3. Funktionen RANK använder i stället den "
"rangordning som brukar användas för placeringar. Därför får båda värdena 10 "
"rangtalet 2."
